# Treat WebAssembly artifacts as opaque binaries.
#
# This file must exist inside oss/ as well as at the monorepo root: oss/ is
# published to a standalone repository via `git subtree push --prefix=oss`,
# where the root .gitattributes is not present. Without it, git text
# normalisation can silently corrupt packages/regorus-wasm/regorusjs_bg.wasm,
# which fails only at runtime as a WebAssembly CompileError.
*.wasm binary
